GameLib - the library of game parts
===================================

GameLib is a set of JavaScript modules for writing games on this
desktop: a main loop that keeps time, a block of pixels to draw
into, shapes and text, the keyboard and a gamepad, a sound
synthesiser, and a high score table. !Pacman is built from them, and
so can your own games be. This guide is for programmers; to play
!Pacman, see its guide, Pacman.

